Live Radio is an independent desktop player. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or supplied by iHeartMedia. Station names, call signs and
streams belong to their respective broadcasters. Station logos are
loaded from the public image service while the app runs and cached
locally; no broadcaster logos or photographs are included in the package.

The application code is provided under the MIT licence.

Uses the public station endpoints at us.api.iheart.com and plays the
public streams hosted by revma.ihrhls.com. Availability depends on the
broadcaster and on your region.
